          "quote": "For a smooth manifold $M$ and a point $p\\in M$, the **cotangent space** at $p$ is the algebraic dual $T_p^*M:=(T_pM)^*$. The **cotangent bundle** is the disjoint union\n$$ T^*M:=\\bigsqcup_{p\\in M} T_p^*M. $$",
