          "quote": "Every compactly supported distribution $v\\in\\mathcal D'(\\mathbb R^n)$ has a\nunique extension $\\widetilde v\\in\\mathcal S'(\\mathbb R^n)$.  Restricting\n$\\widetilde v$ to $\\mathcal D$ recovers $v$.  No choice axiom is required.",
